{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45009","headline":"寄崔万芳夔 · 皎然","name":"寄崔万芳夔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"气杀高隼击，惜芳步寒林。\n风摇苍琅根，霜剪荍𦾾心\n归思忽眇眇，佳气亦沈沈。\n我身岂遐远，如隔湘汉深。\n事迩智莫及，愿乖情不任。\n迟君忘言侣，一笑开吾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}